## Project Objectives

Construction of a utility-scale solar photovoltaic facility in the Mojave Desert, California, delivering clean energy to the California grid.

### Key Deliverables
1. 450 MW solar PV installation
2. 200 MWh battery storage system
3. Substation and grid interconnection
4. Operations and maintenance facility
5. Remote monitoring system

